              "ImageDescription": {
                "value": "Waxing half moon over Brofjorden as seen from Sandvik, Lysekil Municipality, Sweden. In addition to the <i><a class=\"external text\" href=\"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/m%C3%A5ngata\">mångata</a></i> (\"moon street\") there is a reflection of the moon right at the mouth of the fjord. A bright planet to the left of the moon is also creating a reflection in the water. According to <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.astroinfo.se/pa-himlen-i-september-2019-en-overblick/\">this page</a>, it is most likely Jupiter. I keep my camera set to astronomical time, I don't use <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/daylight_saving_time\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:daylight saving time\">daylight saving time</a> for it.",
